// __aluvalakam.qmz — a project office, end to end__
// திட்ட அலுவலகம்: ஒரு திட்டம், தொடக்கம் முதல்
//
// __Run it:  etamil --vm examples/aluvalakam/aluvalakam.qmz__
//
// __One customer-portal project for ACME — திட்டம் வாசல் — taken through what a__
// __PMO does to it: scope and features become tasks, the tasks become a plan on a__
// __calendar with a holiday in it, the charter is checked and rendered, the plan__
// __is rescheduled two weeks in on what actually happened, health and the status__
// __report come out of the data, a change request is reviewed and approved into__
// __new work, every task is prepared for Azure DevOps, and the project takes its__
// __place in the portfolio. The rules are all in nUlakam; what is here is the__
// __project's facts and the order things happen in.__
//
// __Nothing reaches the network. The one Azure DevOps request goes to__
// __127.0.0.1:9, which refuses at once, so the outbox's retry can be seen.__

